    text: "Affected stops:\r\nCO 119 & Fordham St (#26386) (northbound)\r\nCO 119 & S Hover St (#25876) (northbound)\r\nCO 119 & Village at The Peaks Mall (#19763) (northbound)\r\nCO 119 & S Sunset St (#17808) (northbound)\r\nKen Pratt Blvd & S Sunset St (#14442) (southbound)\r\nCO 119 & Village at The Peaks Mall (#19898) (southbound)\r\nCO 119 & S Hover St (#25875) (southbound)\r\nCO 119 & Fordham St (#26385) (southbound)\r\nCO 119 & S Airport Rd (#18005) (southbound)\r\n\nFor northbound BOLT get on/off buses at:\r\nCO 119 & Airport Rd (#19973)\r\nKen Pratt Blvd & S Sherman St (#22885)\r\n\nFor southbound BOLT get on/off buses at:\r\nKen Pratt Blvd & S Sherman St (#17678)\r\nCO 119 & Niwot Rd PnR (#18095)"
